{"kind":"stack","id":"s1","title":"The sun, Earth and moon are round","theme":{"background":"#0b1d3a","foreground":"#ffffff","font":"Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Sphere"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"A ball shape. Every part of its surface is the same distance from the centre."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"globe"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-q","content":"What shape is Earth?"},{"type":"button","id":"c2-a","label":"Flat like a plate","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"Round like a ball","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-c","label":"Square like a box","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Which word means a ball shape?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"Cube","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"Sphere","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"Cylinder","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"ship"},{"type":"text","id":"c4-t","content":"Your class rocket is ready. Do you fly to the moon or to the sun?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Fly to the moon","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Fly to the sun","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"On the moon you see a round grey ball hanging in the sky. The moon is a sphere, like a giant marble."},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"The sun is a huge glowing ball of gas. It looks round from Earth because gravity pulls it into a sphere."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"Approximately spherical"},{"type":"text","id":"c7-e","content":"Almost a ball shape. Earth bulges a little at the middle, so it is not perfectly round."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"moon"},{"type":"text","id":"c8-q","content":"What shape is the moon?"},{"type":"button","id":"c8-a","label":"Round like a ball","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"Flat like a coin","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-c","label":"Pointed like a cone","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"Which body is shaped roughly like a ball?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"The sun","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"A book","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"A brick","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"Is a sphere flat or round?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"Flat","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"Round","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"Pointed","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-q","content":"Which body is only approximately spherical?"},{"type":"button","id":"c11-a","label":"Earth","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c12"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c11-b","label":"A cube","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c12"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c11-c","label":"A pencil","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c12"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c12","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c12-h","content":"Well done! You finished the sphere lesson."},{"type":"text","id":"c12-m","content":"Sun, Earth and moon are all round, like balls. Great work, keep exploring!"}],"actions":[]}}
